  "description": "⭐ <em>Experience an unforgettable evening of flavour and flair with Tasting Menus &amp; Spanish Guitar at Ayllu, where exquisite cuisine meets the enchanting rhythm of live music every Friday and Saturday in Paddington.</em><br><br><strong>Highlights</strong><br> 🎸 Enjoy live Spanish guitar performances in an intimate, elegant setting.<br> 🍽️ Indulge in bold tasting menus combining Japanese precision with Peruvian soul.<br> 🥂 Share a slow, flavourful evening with curated dishes like oysters, crab tacos, short rib, and ceviche.<br> 🌿 Vegetarian options available for a refined plant-based experience.<br> 🌆 Escape the city bustle and linger over dinner in a hidden London gem.<br><br><strong>General Info</strong><br> 📅 Date: Choose in the ticket selector<br> ⏰ Time: 2-hour experience<br> 📍 Location: Ayllu, 25 Sheldon Square, Paddington Central, London, W2 6EY<br> 👤 Age requirement: All ages welcome (under 18s must be accompanied by an adult)<br> 👗 Dress code: Smart/Casual<br> 🍽️ Tasting menus available for the whole table only, with a minimum of two guests per menu<br><br> View<a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.ayllu.co.uk/a-la-carte\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\"> </a>Tasting Menus <a target=\"_blank\" href=\"https://www.ayllu.co.uk/a-la-carte\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">here</a>.<br><br><strong>Description</strong><br> Evenings at Ayllu now come with strings attached – in the best way possible. Join us every Friday and Saturday as the soft, expressive sounds of live Spanish guitar fill our intimate Paddington restaurant. Tucked away from the bustle, Ayllu invites you to slow down and savour the night with a tasting menu designed for sharing. Choose from bold, refined flavours that blend Japanese precision with Peruvian warmth. From tuna tataki to short rib and ceviche, each course is served to the rhythm of the guitar. This is not just dinner – it’s an evening to linger over.<br>",
